# pause-resume.xrs - one pause/resume cycle under `stereo reentry`, judged by the
# per-eye release age at the next projection submit.
#
# Escape opens the game's pause menu (the gameplay verdict drops, the runtime
# shows the head-locked quad) and a second Escape resumes. The resume window
# is where the 2026-09-03 headset run saw the eyes desync; after it both eyes
# must be fresh again (eyeAge 0/0) and no stale submit may have been counted.
# tools\arming-hammer.ps1 loops this with seeded delays. Needs GAMEPLAY and
# the game window reachable (game-key.ps1 foregrounds it).
@mod stereo reentry
@frames 120
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@key Escape
@wait 600
@key Escape
@frames 120
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@assert eyeAgeL le 0
@assert eyeAgeR le 0
@assert projStaleSubmits eq 0
